      "side": 1,
      "message": "I checked another stock qti_battery_charger_main.ko and found a different Xiaomi property layout: BLANK_STATUS\u003d42, SCREEN_CCTOG\u003d43, SOC_DECIMAL\u003d44, QUICK_CHARGE_TYPE\u003d46, APDO_MAX\u003d47, and POWER_MAX\u003d48.\n\nThis confirms that preserving the enum entries is important, but the property IDs appear to differ between charger implementations.\n\nCould you confirm that the values listed in the commit message are specific to M81?",
