      "writtenOn": "2026-10-31T02:25:13Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Hi, I unzipped the latest stock rom and checked the layout on Xiaomi12S China Mainland Firmware and Xiaomi12 European Firmware. I noticed that the layout on CN is 46, and the layout on EEA is 48. Since the Xiaomi12S was only sold in China Mainland, the POWER_MAX\u003d46 fix is 100% correct for Xiaomi12S. To prevent breaking other EEA/GLO firmware, we can either only restrict this patch to mayfly or implement a conditional compile flag (#ifdef CONFIG_M81_ABI_48) in a future patch. Let me know what you prefer!",
      "parentUuid": "feff69fe_8ada17d3",
      "revId": "56a61efcb0fd7615dda462762142a3266ec53a74",
      "serverId": "1ec6b3db-b2c1-4fa4-84a2-4c7efe89ba71"
    },
